{"id":"nave:ahijah","source":"nave","name":"Ahijah","slug":"ahijah","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. Son of Bela 1Ch 8:7","refs":[["1Chr",8,7,8,7]]},{"text":"2. Son of Jerahmeel 1Ch 2:25","refs":[["1Chr",2,25,2,25]]},{"text":"3. A priest in Shiloh, probably identical with Ahimelech, mentioned in 1Sa 22:11","refs":[["1Sam",22,11,22,11]]},{"text":"Was priest in Saul’s reign 1Sa 14:3,18","refs":[["1Sam",14,3,14,3],["1Sam",14,18,14,18]]},{"text":"Killed 1Sa 22:11-19","refs":[["1Sam",22,11,22,19]]},{"text":"4. One of David’s heroes 1Ch 11:36","refs":[["1Chr",11,36,11,36]]},{"text":"Also called ELIAM 2Sa 23:34","refs":[["2Sam",23,34,23,34]]},{"text":"5. A Levite who was treasurer in the tabernacle 1Ch 26:20","refs":[["1Chr",26,20,26,20]]},{"text":"6. Son of Shisha 1Ki 4:3","refs":[["1Kgs",4,3,4,3]]},{"text":"7. A prophet in Shiloh 1Ki 11:29-39","refs":[["1Kgs",11,29,11,39]]},{"text":"8. Father of Baasha 1Ki 15:27,33; 2Ki 9:9","refs":[["1Kgs",15,27,15,27],["1Kgs",15,33,15,33],["2Kgs",9,9,9,9]]},{"text":"9. An Israelite, who subscribed to the covenant of Nehemiah Ne 10:26","refs":[["Neh",10,26,10,26]]}],"refCount":15}
